  "verificationScope": "# Original Koszul cokernel with arbitrary original coefficient module\n\nContinuation AFTER verified/deployed18 originalR-unit component.\nLet R be ANY commutative ring,N ANY original R-module,n>=0,\nH=(H_1,...,H_(n+1)) ORIGINAL ordered equations,I=(H),and\nK_j=exterior^j(R^(n+1)) ORIGINAL exterior Koszul terms.\nThen ACTUAL original precomposition on Hom_R(K_n,N) identifies at the\nSAME original ordered top generator with image EXACTLY I N.\nThe ACTUAL original top Hom-cokernel into N is CONSTRUCTED equivalent\n to ORIGINAL N/I N. The SAME original class [L] goes to ORIGINAL\n L(v_(n+1)) modulo I N. Kernel equality and surjectivity are PROVED.\nNo conditions of regularity,FP/freeness/invertibility/flatness/CM of N,\nNoetherianity,field or assumed image/cokernel/quotient equivalence.\n\nAlso PROVE actual whole affine internal-Hom iso precomposition\nnaturality for arbitrary ORIGINAL target N,using pinned mathlib\nLinearMap.lcomp and actual tilde adjunction;only SOURCE M,Mprime FP.\nNo scalar/square compatibility certificate. Original local canonical\nmodule may be nonfree/noninvertible;no canonical identification assumed.\n\nACTUAL original N-coefficient Hom-Koszul top precomposition has image EXACTLY I N and CONSTRUCTED cokernel ~= ORIGINAL N/I N;class ORIGINAL L goes to ORIGINAL L(v_r) mod I N. All statements are ANY commutative original R,n+1 original ordered equations,and ANY original N,without source-target regularity/field/Noetherian/FP/free/flat/invertible/CM/ideal-image/equivalence certificates. Continue after the frozen18 originalR-coefficient component:for ANY ORIGINAL target R-module N,ACTUAL original global Hom-value precomposition and actual whole constructed tilde/internal-Hom isomorphism naturality are PROVED from existing section values and tilde adjunction. Reuse pinned mathlib LinearMap.lcomp for ORIGINAL phi o f. Only ORIGINAL source modules M,Mprime FP for whole sheaf iso;NO FP/freeness/invertibility/Noetherian/CM/flatness/canonical comparison conditions on ORIGINAL N. Original canonical coefficient module can be noninvertible. The ACTUAL N-coefficient MODULE Koszul image,quotient and restriction are now PROVED. The ACTUAL associated N/I N sheaf is CONSTRUCTED isomorphic to ACTUAL pushforward from SAME ORIGINAL cut Spec R/I of SAME canonical quotient tensor (R/I) tensor_R N,using existing actual quotient-tensor and native tildePushforwardIso. No desired iso input;original quotient ring map and coefficient values retained. Abstract categorical scalar-restriction identity requires ordinary algebra/module scalar tower;the applied quotient tensor has this CANONICAL tower,derived automatically. ACTUAL general-N internal-Hom top sequence and its original restriction square are now CONSTRUCTED and PROVED exact/epi,using same original Koszul terms,source FP DERIVED from original exterior basis,actual whole original N-valued Hom sheaf iso naturality and actual associated-Hom short-complex iso. Original last map agrees with original N/I N coefficient restriction under constructed term iso. ANY original N,NO target FP/free/flat/invertibility/CM,no originalH regularity/Noetherian/field/desired exactness or Hom/quotient/iso/square certificate. Geometric pullback comparison with original i^*N and original global frames/twists,GLOBAL epsilon/connecting,derived SHEAF/proper-duality remain OPEN. Frozen18 manifest itself remains originalR-only,unchanged. Original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,theta UNVERIFIED,checkpoint180,same guards and alloldholds.\n\nACTUAL tilde of original N/I N is CONSTRUCTED isomorphic to actual\npushforward from SAME original Spec R/I of actual tilde of SAME canonical\nquotient tensor (R/I) tensor_R N,using existing quotient tensor equiv and\nactual native tildePushforwardIso;canonical scalar tower is derived.\nACTUAL original N-coefficient affine associated-Hom and internal-Hom top\nshort complexes are CONSTRUCTED with SAME original Koszul differential,\noriginal coefficient restriction and SAME actual closed cut pushforward.\nTheir actual short-complex isos,exactness,epi and original restriction\nsquares are PROVED. Original source Koszul FP derived from original\nexterior basis;NO FP/free/flat/invertibility/CM/exactness/iso/square\ncertificate is supplied for original N.\n\nOPEN: geometric comparison with original i^*(tilde N),original global\nlocal-frame/twist gluing,GLOBAL epsilon/connecting-class comparisons,derived\nSHEAF/proper-duality,original fixed-m section production. Normalized\ntheta UNVERIFIED;original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,checkpoint180. MODULE cokernel\ncomputation does not claim GLOBAL original Koszul a_*epsilon=a|_S.\nThe already published18 immutable component remains originalR-target;\nthis coefficient-generalization does not modify its archive or flags.\n\n5 root modules,461 physical lines,26 exact declarations\n(14 proofs/12 definitions);51\nclosed modules,46 byte-identical earlier frozen deps.\nAll26 full types manually read;standard3axioms only. Guarded singlecompiler\n8GiB,2threads,CPU25%,20min;all oldholds preserved. No full-project/remote\nLean CI claim. Lean4.35.0-rc3,mathlib2a885768dae569d938bb9ff3474da6a8753bb90a.\n",
